Z||000000||JetroGT||12-20-2000||12:34 AM||||At first I thought it was a loose rod, but now I know it's the tranny. When the clutch is out and in nutral I can hear it rattle. But as soon as I push the clutch in it stops. Is this serious? Should I just get the clutch replaced?  Any suggestions would be helpful. <BR>It's an 87 V6 5spd getrag.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Alex4mula||12-20-2000||08:55 AM||||Usually is the other way around. When my throwout bearing was going bad the rattle was when pressing the clutch (i.e bearing). Still definitely sounds clutch related. Time for disassembly. If possible replace all. Don't wanna disassemble again later for other thing.||||reg||1
