Z||000003||LAMBO||12-20-2000||01:01 PM||||ditto with alex4mula. I'm in the middle of changing mine right now. I'm ready to put her back together, but its just too damn cold.<P>Just a thought, but could the bushings that hold your clutch release arm in alignment through the bellhouseing be worn enough that it is allowing the arm to sit there and rattle when there is no pressure on it. I've heard this is a common problem with manuals.<BR>TL||||reg||1
